      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>Other rituals will surely arise — songs, prayers, art, and silence — each guided by the wisdom and imagination of artists, rabbis, and ritual leaders who help us make meaning in the wake of sorrow and hope. Let us honor both the moment and the movement — the courage to create holiness even as we live toward wholeness.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_63935_introduction"/>
