      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>“A Prayer for Burying ‘Bring Them Home Now’ Dog Tags” by Rabbi Menachem Creditor was shared through the Open Siddur Project’s Facebook discussion group, and elsewhere on social media on 10 October 2025, in anticipation of the final living hostage’s release on 13 October 2025.</tei:p>
